  "description": "An Ace is a Finest with more\n\nstability designed into it, and a shorter top tube to facilitate a more upright\n\nriding position. An Ace's head angle is shallower and its wheelbase is slightly\n\nlonger; Both those design decisions promote stability and a relaxed rider.\n\nThe Ace frame is made of Cro-moly steel. The steel fork is aero-style and\n\nhandsome. The frame has mounts for two bottle cages and for a luggage rack\n\nor fenders. Like the Finest, the Ace features Shimano Sora components and\n\nthree chain rings for lots of gear choices, 21 of them technically. An Ace would be a wonderful partner on your first century\n\nor club ride. It would be terrific for drifting from inn to inn in New England\n\nin September. Perfect for one of those cross-state rides like RAGBRAI or...",
